#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:1
msgid "HM-D13-LoRa 首次使用"
msgstr "HM-D13-LoRa Getting Started"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:6
msgid ""
"将 **HM-D13-LoRa 套件**从开箱状态运行到移动站首次获得 **RTK 固定解**。套件使"
"用本地 LoRa 差分链路，不需要 SIM 卡或 CORS 账号。"
msgstr ""
"Operate the **HM-D13-LoRa kit** from the out-of-the-box state to the rover’s "
"first acquisition of an **RTK fixed solution**. The kit uses a local LoRa "
"correction link and does not require a SIM card or CORS account."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:9
msgid "1. 核对套件"
msgstr "Step 1: Check the kit"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:11
msgid "产品配备："
msgstr "Package includes:"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:12
msgid "HM-D13-LoRa 移动站和 5-pin GH1.25 mm 接口线缆。"
msgstr "HM-D13-LoRa rover and 5-pin GH1.25 mm interface cable."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:13
msgid "兼容 3.3 V UART I/O 的 USB 转 UART 转接器。"
msgstr "USB-to-UART adapter compatible with 3.3 V UART I/O."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:14
msgid ""
"配套专用 D13 LoRa 基站硬件、基站外置 LoRa 天线和封装好的 4-pin USB 线缆。"
msgstr ""
"Dedicated D13 LoRa base station, external base-station LoRa antenna, and "
"sealed 4-pin USB cable."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:15
msgid "基站安装支架及随套件提供的附件。"
msgstr ""
"Base station installation brackets and the accessories provided with the kit."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:17
msgid "用户自备："
msgstr "User provides:"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:18
msgid "移动站和基站所需的 5 V ±0.5 V 电源。"
msgstr "5 V ±0.5 V power supplies for the rover and base station."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:20
msgid ""
"基站和移动站出厂默认配对；专用 D13 LoRa 基站硬件不单独销售，也不作为移动站使"
"用。"
msgstr ""
"The base station and rover are factory-paired by default; the dedicated D13 "
"LoRa base station hardware is not sold separately and is not used as a rover."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:27
msgid "HM-D13-LoRa 移动站主要组件与包装"
msgstr "HM-D13-LoRa rover components and packaging"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:27
msgid "HM-D13-LoRa 移动站主要组件"
msgstr "HM-D13-LoRa rover components"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:35
msgid "配套 D13 LoRa 基站主要组件与包装"
msgstr "Included D13 LoRa base-station components and packaging"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:35
msgid "配套 D13 LoRa 基站主要组件"
msgstr "Included D13 LoRa base-station components"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:39
msgid ""
"图片用于辅助识别产品和主要组件；实际交付内容以本页文字清单和随货装箱清单为"
"准。"
msgstr ""
"Images are provided to help identify the product and its major components. "
"The written list on this page and the packing list supplied with the product "
"define the actual contents."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:42
msgid "2. 确认输出协议"
msgstr "Step 2: Confirm output protocol"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:44
msgid ""
"D13 默认输出 10 Hz NMEA，可按需求配置为 UBX。接入前按目标设备确认交付输出协"
"议。"
msgstr ""
"D13 defaults to 10 Hz NMEA and can be configured for UBX on request. Confirm "
"the delivered output protocol before connecting the target device."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:46
msgid "3. 架设 D13 基站"
msgstr "Step 3: Set up the D13 base station"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:48
msgid ""
"按[LoRa 基站架设](../differential-links/d13-base-station.md)完成安装和供电。"
"基站上电后保持静止；移动后需要重新上电。"
msgstr ""
"Follow [Setting Up the LoRa Base Station](../differential-links/d13-base-"
"station.md) to install and power the base station. Keep it stationary after "
"power-on; power-cycle it after any move."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:50
msgid "4. 安装并连接移动站"
msgstr "Step 4: Install and connect the rover"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:52
msgid ""
"D13 移动站使用内置 LoRa 天线。将设备安装在天空视野开阔的位置，并按[D13 接口与"
"接线](../operation/d13-wiring.md)连接：5 V ±0.5 V 供电，3.3 V UART/PPS I/O，"
"TX/RX 交叉连接并共地。"
msgstr ""
"The D13 rover has a built-in LoRa antenna. Install it with an open sky view, "
"then follow [D13 Interfaces and Wiring](../operation/d13-wiring.md): supply "
"5 V ±0.5 V, use 3.3 V UART/PPS I/O, cross TX/RX, and connect ground."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:54
msgid "5. 查看定位输出"
msgstr "Step 5: Check positioning output"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:56
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"串口默认 115200 bps。按{ref}`连接 NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>`或使用目"
"标设备确认当前配置的协议持续输出，常规地面版为 10 Hz NMEA。"
msgstr ""
"The serial port defaults to 115200 bps. Follow {ref}`Connecting to "
"NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>` or use the target device to verify "
"continuous output in the configured protocol. Standard ground firmware "
"outputs 10 Hz NMEA."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:58
msgid "6. 验证 RTK 固定解"
msgstr "Step 6: Verify RTK Fixed Solution"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:60
msgid ""
"按[LoRa 移动站连接](../differential-links/lora.md)和[RTK 状态与固定解验证]"
"(../operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md)，使用与当前输出协议兼容的工具检查定位"
"输出和解状态。"
msgstr ""
"Follow [Connecting a LoRa Rover](../differential-links/lora.md) and "
"[Checking RTK Status and the Fixed Solution](../operation/rtk-fixed-"
"validation.md). Use a tool compatible with the current output protocol."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:62
msgid "首次使用完成判据"
msgstr "Getting Started success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:65
msgid "**基站稳定工作，移动站持续输出定位数据并进入 RTK 固定解。**"
msgstr ""
"**The base station remains stable, and the rover outputs positioning data "
"continuously and reaches an RTK fixed solution.**"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:68
msgid ""
"若无法进入固定解，检查基站是否被移动、基站天线和供电、链路遮挡、移动站位置和"
"天空视野，再进入[故障排查](../troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md)。"
msgstr ""
"If it is not possible to achieve a fixed solution, check whether the base "
"station has been moved, the base station antenna and power supply, any link "
"obstructions, the rover position, and sky visibility, then proceed to "
"[Troubleshooting](../troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d13-lora.md:70
msgid "下一步"
msgstr "Next steps"

